  "privacyBody": "QuickBill keeps your invoices, clients, items and business profile on this phone. There is no account and no IRR Dev Labs server. A backup is a file you export yourself. Free users may see Google AdMob ads. QuickBill Pro is billed by Google Play. Anonymous usage events and crash reports may be sent through Firebase. They never include names, amounts, phone numbers or emails. Questions: irrdevlabs.support@gmail.com.",
