  "termsBody": "QuickBill Pro is an optional subscription billed by Google Play (quickbill_pro_monthly or quickbill_pro_yearly). A free trial, when Google Play offers one, becomes a paid plan unless you cancel in Google Play before it ends. You can cancel anytime in Google Play. Access continues until the period you already paid for ends. Invoices and receipts you create stay on your phone. IRR Dev Labs provides the app for making invoices and receipts. Questions: irrdevlabs.support@gmail.com."
